# textdomain: dw_core
# Slovenian translation of DoggioWars. English is the source language.

SCORE @1=TOČKE @1
Gamepad: PS4/PS5 DualShock needs Settings -> Controls -> Gamepads -> Joystick type @= ps5. Xbox works on 'auto'. See GAMEPAD.md.=Igralni plošček: DualShock PS4/PS5 potrebuje Nastavitve -> Upravljanje -> Igralni ploščki -> Vrsta krmilne palice @= ps5. Xbox deluje na »auto«. Glej GAMEPAD.md.
Toggle the fullscreen world map=Preklopi celozaslonski zemljevid sveta
Player not found=Igralca ni mogoče najti
Spore Block=Blok spor
Magma Block=Blok magme
Ice Crystal=Ledeni kristal
Dead Stone=Mrtvi kamen
Embers=Žerjavica
Ash=Pepel
Mud=Blato
Glowing Crystal=Svetleči kristal
Basalt=Bazalt
Mossy Stone=Mahovit kamen
HARE WAITING — catch up!=ZAJEC ČAKA — ujemi ga!
HARE AT THE FINISH — fly to it!=ZAJEC JE NA CILJU — leti do njega!
SLALOM! Stay on the hare=SLALOM! Ostani za zajcem
HARE: BARREL ROLL! (double-tap A/D)=ZAJEC: BARREL ROLL! (dvojni pritisk A/D)
HARD TURN! S+A/D @= airbrake drift=OSTER ZAVOJ! S+A/D @= drsenje z zračno zavoro
TUNNEL! Slow down (S) and fly clean=TUNEL! Upočasni (S) in leti natančno
CLIMB + DIVE! Shift down for extra speed=VZPON + STRMOGLAV! Shift dol za večjo hitrost
FINISH — @1  |  SCORE @2=CILJ — @1  |  TOČKE @2
Race finished in @1! Checkpoints @2/@3, score @4.=Dirka končana v @1! Kontrolne točke @2/@3, točke @4.
Race failed — fighter destroyed.=Dirka neuspešna — letalo uničeno.
Greyhound race — chase the golden hare! /race stop cancels it=Dirka hrtov — lovi zlatega zajca! /race stop jo prekliče
Race cancelled.=Dirka preklicana.
No race is running.=Nobena dirka ne poteka.
A race is already running — end it with /race stop.=Dirka že poteka — končaj jo z /race stop.
You are not in a fighter.=Nisi v lovskem letalu.
Could not spawn the hare.=Zajca ni bilo mogoče ustvariti.
RACE! Follow the golden hare!=DIRKA! Sledi zlatemu zajcu!
Race started — follow the hare!=Dirka se je začela — sledi zajcu!
HARE @1 m  ·  CP @2/@3=ZAJEC @1 m  ·  CP @2/@3
Welcome to DoggioWars! You ARE the fighter — fly!=Dobrodošel v DoggioWars! TI SI lovsko letalo — leti!
Toggle the island radar (minimap)=Preklopi radar otokov (mini zemljevid)
Radar OFF.=Radar IZKLOPLJEN.
Radar ON.=Radar VKLOPLJEN.
BARREL ROLL!=BARREL ROLL!
LOOPING!=LOOPING!
IMMELMANN!=IMMELMANN!
BOOST!=BOOST!
Fighter destroyed! Respawning...=Letalo uničeno! Ponovni nastanek...
Debug: respawn your fighter at your position=Debug: ponovno ustvari letalo na tvojem položaju
Fighter respawned!=Letalo ponovno ustvarjeno!
Fly to the nearest island; /island <biome> @= nearest of that biome=Leti do najbližjega otoka; /island <biom> @= najbližji otok tega bioma
Unknown biome '@1' (or none nearby). Biomes: @2=Neznan biom »@1« (ali nobenega v bližini). Biomi: @2
@1 island at (@2, @3, @4), r@=@5, @6 blocks away - it is right in front of you. Give it a moment to generate.=Otok @1 na (@2, @3, @4), r@=@5, oddaljen @6 blokov — tik pred teboj je. Počakaj trenutek, da se ustvari.
@1 island, r@=@2, was @3 blocks away - it is in front of you. Give it a moment to generate.=Otok @1, r@=@2, je bil oddaljen @3 blokov — pred teboj je. Počakaj trenutek, da se ustvari.
Moving to island.=Premik na otok.
Fly above coordinates: /goto <x> <z> or /goto <x> <y> <z>=Leti nad koordinate: /goto <x> <z> ali /goto <x> <y> <z>
Usage: /goto <x> <z> or /goto <x> <y> <z>=Uporaba: /goto <x> <z> ali /goto <x> <y> <z>
Flying to (@1, @2, @3).=Letim na (@1, @2, @3).
Fly to the home island at the world origin=Leti na domači otok v izhodišču sveta
Flying to the home island (0,0) - it will be in front of you.=Letim na domači otok (0,0) — imel ga boš pred seboj.
Gamepad diagnostics: live view of sticks and pressed buttons=Diagnostika ploščka: prikaz palic in pritisnjenih gumbov v živo
Gamepad diagnostics ON — press buttons and move the sticks, and watch what lights up mid-screen.=Diagnostika ploščka VKLOPLJENA — pritiskaj gumbe, premikaj palice in glej, kaj zasveti sredi zaslona.
Gamepad diagnostics OFF.=Diagnostika ploščka IZKLOPLJENA.
Switch controls: fighter <-> submarine=Preklopi upravljanje: lovsko letalo <-> podmornica
SUBMARINE: left stick @= thrust/strafe, look @= heading, X @= up, O @= down. Tricks and boost are off.=PODMORNICA: leva palica @= potisk/bočni premik, pogled @= smer, X @= gor, O @= dol. Figure in boost so izklopljeni.
FIGHTER: classic flight controls.=LOVSKO LETALO: klasično upravljanje leta.
CHECKPOINT @1/@2=KONTROLNA TOČKA @1/@2
